My project is a program that tracks fitness activities. Such as diffrent workouts you make your self. They can either be workouts or cardio. You can say what you did that day or set goals and it counts up towards those goals. Such as if you want to hit a personal record on a workout you set the goal and keep entering what you have done. Ex if I want a PR attempt at bench press which is 225 you set that goal at 225 and then can keep entering your max until you have hit that goal. 